industry_detail={
'web-developer-jabalpur':'For a local service website, answer whether the work is available in Jabalpur, what kinds of projects are a fit and how an enquiry will be handled. Real examples and a precise service description are more persuasive than a list of unsupported rankings.',
'wordpress-developer-jabalpur':'The editing workflow matters as much as the public design. A business owner should be able to update a service, image or article without breaking the page layout. Plugin choices should be kept purposeful and documented.',
'seo-expert-jabalpur':'Technical SEO begins with pages that search engines can reach and people can understand. A useful local page states the service, location, process and contact details clearly, then earns relevance through real content and business evidence.',
'small-business-websites':'A small business often needs a compact but complete site. A customer may arrive with one question, so the page hierarchy should guide them from the offer to details, proof and direct contact without forcing a long search.',
'real-estate-websites':'Property pages should carry specific location, type, status and features. Filters can help when inventory is large, but a small catalog can often be clearer with well-organized categories and detailed individual listings.',
'education-websites':'Families need dependable, current information. Course details, admission steps, fees or schedules should be written and maintained by the institute. A publishing workflow helps prevent stale notices from staying prominent.',
'health-wellness-websites':'Trust comes from accurate descriptions of the people, services and practical booking details. Avoid promising outcomes that the page cannot support; let the visitor understand the process before contacting the business.',
'portfolio-websites':'A portfolio should show a selected set of work with context: the brief, the decisions and what shipped. A concise resume and visible contact route help a prospective client understand both capability and fit.'}
